<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-046-B habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.190288" lon="-120.833707"><name>SC26-046-B</name><desc>Avila rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 9.6 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 66/100; not catch probability. Center 48 ft; nearby 35–69 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. About 902 m from screened closed/access-restricted area; plan entire drift clear. Parts of the investigation circle are shallower than 40 ft. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9KBGELE"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-028</name><desc>Partial mapped habitat footprint clipped to a 225-m search window to retain complete depth coverage; not the entire reef or a single pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.191713148459485" lon="-120.83526163508232"/><trkpt lat="35.19162304144295" lon="-120.8352640262746"/><trkpt lat="35.191611261993" lon="-120.83460543574871"/><trkpt lat="35.19214994020675" lon="-120.83448131830258"/><trkpt lat="35.192153310227134" lon="-120.83466970403776"/><trkpt lat="35.192240934842644" lon="-120.83437240330068"/><trkpt lat="35.192311709491975" lon="-120.83381811507586"/><trkpt lat="35.192228263270586" lon="-120.83382033103672"/><trkpt lat="35.192220405350604" lon="-120.83338126780725"/><trkpt lat="35.192130298453776" lon="-120.83338366112054"/><trkpt lat="35.19212636891048" lon="-120.83316412981159"/><trkpt lat="35.192036262025226" lon="-120.8331665233563"/><trkpt lat="35.191942225223684" lon="-120.83294938610798"/><trkpt lat="35.19176201147183" lon="-120.83295417362838"/><trkpt lat="35.19176004637839" lon="-120.83284440849513"/><trkpt lat="35.19166993950676" lon="-120.83284680236041"/><trkpt lat="35.1916738695812" lon="-1